insertion.cu -- Basic DDP1 work
insertion_v1.cu -- only removes atomicCAS loop 
insertion_v2.cu -- removes atomicCAS loop + warp per node. 
insertion_v3.cu -- insertion_v2 + some aggresive optimizations like __ldg() for read only data like graphs. Read only cache is used which is usually faster than L1/L2 cache. (Okayish)
insertion_v3_exp.cu -- delta stepping 
insertion_v3_exp_1.cu -- delta stepping 


How to use:
./executable startNode EndNode

possible endpoints - (10986 25198), (184814 281112), (266169 270353)

